  "description": "Just when Hayeon thought her luck couldn't get worse, a freak accident lands her smack in the middle of the trashy romance novel she wrote back in high school. But this isn't some fun fantasy—it's a nightmare. From the calculating psychopath Sunwoo to the obsessive, love-starved Yihan and the terrifying stalker Chanseung, every one of these male leads is a walking disaster. Is this second chance the miracle Hayeon’s been waiting for, or will she regret ever writing this chaos into existence? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
